# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [0.3.0] - 2026-03-18
### Added
- **Cloud API — Modular Architecture (FASE 1):**
  - Refactored from monolithic 3-endpoint app to modular structure (core/, models/, routers/)
  - JWT admin authentication (`POST /admin/login` → token)
  - License management endpoints: check, create/renew, revoke, list (JWT-protected)
  - Health check with database connectivity status (`GET /health`)
  - Rate limiting with slowapi
  - CORS configuration
  - Request logging middleware
  - Backward-compatible `/check-license` endpoint for existing Desktop clients
  - Swagger/OpenAPI docs at `/docs`
- **Database Migrations:**
  - Alembic setup with autogenerate support
  - Initial migration: licenses (with updated_at), releases, tenants tables
- **Models:**
  - `License`: hardware_id, client_name, expiration_date, is_active, timestamps
  - `Release`: version, download_url, changelog, is_active (ready for auto-update)
  - `Tenant`: name, type (VET/SUPPLIER/BOTH), tax_id, contact info, plan, region
- **Docker:**
  - cloud_api volume mount for hot-reload development
  - JWT_SECRET, DEBUG, CORS_ORIGINS, RATE_LIMIT_DEFAULT env vars
- **Config:**
  - Centralized settings via pydantic-settings (`core/config.py`)
  - Updated PRODUCTION_URL to `api.vetcore.app`

## [0.2.0] - 2026-03-17
### Added
- **Clinical Module:**
  - Medical records with consultations and attachments (file upload)
  - Vaccine tracking per patient
  - Appointment scheduling with calendar/agenda view (drag-and-drop)
- **Point of Sale (POS):**
  - Cart-based sales workflow
  - Barcode scanner support (camera via html5-qrcode + USB reader)
  - Payment method tracking
  - Sale detail view with print option
- **Cash Register Reports:**
  - Daily/shift-based cash closing
  - Breakdown by payment method
  - Date and shift filters
- **Team Management:**
  - Multi-user with roles (Veterinarian, Administrative)
  - Employee CRUD, activate/deactivate, password reset
  - PIN-based quick user switching
  - Lockscreen with kiosk mode
  - User avatars
- **Settings Hub:**
  - Redesigned `/settings/` page with tabbed layout (Company, Database, Data Import)
  - Company configuration: name, tax ID, currency (11 currencies), language
  - Backup: download SQLite database with auto-safety copies
  - Restore: upload backup with server folder browser
  - `@localhost_required` decorator for sensitive endpoints
- **Vetter Data Import:**
  - Import from FoxPro .DBF files (clients, patients, records, vaccines, products, sales)
  - Table selection with checkboxes and dependency enforcement
  - Record count analysis before import
  - Automatic backup before import starts
- **Internationalization (i18n):**
  - Full English translation of codebase (models, views, templates)
  - Django i18n with `{% trans %}` tags throughout all templates
  - Language support: Spanish (es), English (en), Portuguese (pt)
  - Per-company language setting
- **Search & Pagination:**
  - Server-side search on client list and patient list
  - Paginated results with search persistence
- **Inventory Enhancements:**
  - QR label printing for products
  - Barcode field on Product model
- **License System:**
  - Offline license validation (Hardware ID-based perpetual key)
  - Online subscription validation via Cloud API
  - 3-day offline grace period
  - Hybrid mode: seamless switch between offline and online

### Changed
- **Architecture:** Complete refactoring to hybrid Desktop (SQLite) + SaaS (PostgreSQL) architecture
- **Docker Compose:** 5-service setup (api_desktop, api_saas, db, cloud_api, cloud_db)
- **Models:** Added multi-tenant Company model, UserProfile with roles/PIN/avatar
- **Templates:** Migrated all views from Spanish to English with i18n support

## [0.1.0] - 2026-01-30
### Added
- **Infrastructure:** Docker + Docker Compose setup (Django + PostgreSQL)
- **Core:** Client and Patient (Pet) management with CRUD
- **Inventory:** Products & Services module
  - Low stock visual alerts
  - Product vs Service differentiation
  - Stock movement tracking (In/Out)
- **Frontend:** Django Templates with Bootstrap 5
- **Dashboard:** Home panel with quick access shortcuts and local IP detection
- **Hybrid:** Logic in `settings.py` to detect Docker (Dev) vs Windows Native (Prod with SQLite)
- **API:** Basic REST endpoints with Django Rest Framework (DRF)
